     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The attached .jar files are fedora-client.jar replacements that fix this issue for Fedora 2.2.4 and 3.1, respectively.  To apply:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "1) Back up your existing fedora/client/fedora-client.jar file",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "2) Download the appropriate jar and save it as fedora/client/fedora-client.jar (over the existing file)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "If you use a source distribution, you can find the relevant source code for the class that changed (BatchModifyParser) at:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "For applying to 2.2.4:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://fedora-commons.svn.sourceforge.net/viewvc/fedora-commons/fedora/branches/maintenance-2.2/src/java/fedora/client/batch/BatchModifyParser.java?revision=7910"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://fedora-commons.svn.sourceforge.net/viewvc/fedora-commons/fedora/branches/maintenance-2.2/src/java/fedora/client/batch/BatchModifyParser.java?revision=7910",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "For applying to 3.1:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://fedora-commons.svn.sourceforge.net/viewvc/fedora-commons/fedora/trunk/src/java/fedora/client/batch/BatchModifyParser.java?revision=7902"
            },
            "type": "link"
